      "reason": "CMIP6 land and below-sea-floor cells use the missing value 1e20, so they must be masked before computing MLD, differences and means.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Build each field's valid mask from the field itself (masks differ between variables of one model), reduce NaN-aware with weights masked to the same cells, and keep land missing so it stays out of area fractions; a value near 1e20 in output is an unmasked fill value, not a result."
